# panel-src phase 9 — Holoo ERP integration (Nov 2026, per the owner's
# integration specification + HOLOO-PHASE0-REPORT-fa.md design map)
#
# Server-side ONLY additions on the EXISTING Next.js panel (no parallel
# infrastructure, no new dependencies — Node 24 global fetch):
#  * prisma/schema.prisma: ErpCustomer / ErpProduct / ErpPayment /
#    HolooSyncLog models + Customer.erpCode (the single bridge) +
#    Purchase.holooJson (raw invoice provenance).
#  * src/instrumentation.ts: idempotent DDL for the four new tables and
#    the two new columns + the periodic sync scheduler start (a timer in
#    the SAME server process; config re-read every tick).
#  * src/lib/holoo-config.ts: connection settings in the existing Config
#    KV (enabled/baseUrl/dbname/username/password(write-only, base64)/
#    syncIntervalMin 1..1440 default 3) + token cache helpers.
#  * src/lib/holoo.ts: the Holoo HTTP client — POST /Login with
#    {"userinfo":{username,userpass(base64),dbname}}, Authorization header
#    from the login Token, ONE auto re-login on 401, timeouts, classified
#    errors (never credentials), tolerant response/list/field mappers and
#    a sha256 content hash for change detection.
#  * src/lib/holoo-sync.ts: the orchestrator — periodic FULL comparison
#    with contentHash upserts keyed by the stable ErpCode (date.from/
#    date.to NOT trusted for change detection until verified on the real
#    service), strict data-ownership (only Erp* tables + bridging fields
#    are written), NO-DELETE policy (absence != delete), MedPad customer
#    linking (erpCode -> unique normalized name -> new UNASSIGNED row,
#    never auto-assignment), invoice -> Purchase(source='holoo') with one
#    total line + holooJson, per-customer payments from Report/GetCustPay
#    with polite pacing, one-run-at-a-time guard, full per-run logging.
#  * API routes (admin): holoo/settings (GET/PUT, password never
#    returned), holoo/test (REAL login + read-only endpoint probing),
#    holoo/sync (manual trigger, fire-and-forget), holoo/status (counts +
#    last logs + scheduler state), holoo/products (read-only list).
#  * /api/app/customers: additive `erp` block (mandeh/credit) + the
#    incremental-sync trigger ErpCustomer.lastSyncedAt > since — the app
#    NEVER talks to Holoo directly; /api/customers/[id]/profile and
#    /api/app/customers/[id]/profile gain erpAccount + erpPayments.
#  * Panel UI: the new «هلو» dashboard tab (HolooTab — settings, real
#    connection test with endpoint probe results, manual sync, counts,
#    logs, products, HTTP/internal-network warning) + the Holoo financial
#    block in the customer 360 profile.
